1
00:00:00,859 --> 00:00:03,489
(Sheldon:)Although advertised to appear,
he did not show up.

2
00:00:03,654 --> 00:00:07,364
(Sheldon:)It was at that moment
I vowed eternal hatred for Wil Wheaton.

3
00:00:08,325 --> 00:00:11,115
(Raj:)Okay, great,
you can tell him you hate him. Sign here.

4
00:00:11,287 --> 00:00:14,707
It might interest you to know
that Wil Wheaton currently ranks sixth...

5
00:00:14,873 --> 00:00:18,463
(Sheldon:)...on my all-time enemies list, right
between director Joel Schumacher...

6
00:00:18,627 --> 00:00:21,297
(Sheldon:)...who nearly destroyed
the Batman movie franchise...

7
00:00:21,463 --> 00:00:24,173
(Sheldon:)...and Billy Sparks,
who lived down the street from me...

8
00:00:24,341 --> 00:00:26,681
(Sheldon:)...and put dog poop
on the handles of my bicycle.

9
00:00:26,844 --> 00:00:28,924
(Raj:)Okay, I get it. He's a bad guy.
Sign here.

10
00:00:29,096 --> 00:00:33,436
(Sheldon:)In the words of Khan Noonien Singh
in the immortal Wrath of Khan:

11
00:00:33,601 --> 00:00:38,401
"He tasks me.
He tasks me and I shall have him."

12
00:00:38,564 --> 00:00:43,194
(Raj:)-No doubt. Sign here.
-"From hell's heart, I stab at thee."

13
00:00:45,988 --> 00:00:48,908
(Howard:)All right, Raj.
Looks like you're teamed up with...

14
00:00:49,074 --> 00:00:51,164
..."Die, Wil Wheaton, die."

15
00:00:57,708 --> 00:01:01,018
(Howard:)So tell me more
about the future mother of my children.

